# Myrto, baking in her yard. Three questions, three conversations: her house,
# how the bread is baked (and her mother's counting), and the quarrel with the
# potter over smoke when the wind turns off the land; and an
# errand (Quests): a loom weight gone missing, thanked for when it comes back.
# Text is a key: the panel translates it, so EN/RU stay in strings.csv.
# Indent with tabs: DM's INDENT_REGEX is ^\t+.

~ start
if Game.quest_ready("loom_weight")
	Myrto: LOC_Q_LOOM_DONE
	do Game.complete_quest("loom_weight")
	=> END
Myrto: NPC_BAKER_1
- LOC_BAKER_CHOICE_1
	Myrto: NPC_BAKER_3
	Myrto: LOC_BAKER_HOUSE_1
- LOC_BAKER_CHOICE_2
	Myrto: NPC_BAKER_2
	Myrto: LOC_BAKER_COUNT_1
	Myrto: NPC_BAKER_4
- LOC_BAKER_CHOICE_3
	Myrto: LOC_BAKER_SMOKE_1
	Myrto: LOC_BAKER_SMOKE_2
- LOC_Q_LOOM_ASK [if Game.quest_offered("loom_weight")]
	Myrto: LOC_Q_LOOM_1
	Myrto: LOC_Q_LOOM_2
	do Game.take_quest("loom_weight")
=> END
